Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth, a legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\Nthen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all not daunted. Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\Nthen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece. I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it so fast I could first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wave in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, we have to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We either get out of here\Ntoday or we die trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be on top of us in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never go back to Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up till we cross the Red Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlotte, I never got\Nto visit the Marine Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I never got to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots get over it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and keep rowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we had made it after\Nwe got past the sleeping kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they ambushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At 10,000 meters below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And with so many sea monsters at their
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Disposal. There was no\Nway to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They told us we could join the new\Nfish man pirates or we could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As if they were really giving us a choice\Nat all who wouldn't pick life over death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you all to get over it. We're\Nlucky to even be alive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, they escaped. I'm\Nafraid so, boss. Humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,are always running for it\Nyou'd think they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have learned by now\Ncowardice is in their nature
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you shouldn't let me chew\Non them when I offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No it's good see now we\Ncan use them as examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go and drag them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can teach them their lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this time you won't. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the bubble ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take that\Nmuch power drug at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, shall we go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get to anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, Mr. Apoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As in the super famous designer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd be taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I live for this kind of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm in the water, I'm what\Nyou'd call a fashionable starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But on Fishman Island, I'm\Nso much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as I'm the president and lead\Ndesigner for criminal brand clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The products we make are\Ncoveted throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No country is off limits\Nfor our store chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Dosgoy Panda is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you listening? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first floor is\Na criminal brand store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys, what about my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, I'm sorry, but I\Ncan't accommodate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving you a discount like\Nthat could cost me my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone is\Ncausing them trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,People have some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how cute\Nthese clothes are They're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,way too expensive Speaking\Nof nerve I want you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to cut the price to\N10,000 berries But that's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,less than half the retail\Nprice You must understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that. It's just\Nas I thought, cheapskate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are, Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness you\Nshowed up, Monsieur Papagu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants half off,\Njust like her wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one in charge\Nof this extortion ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You lower your prices, or\NI'll lower you. Oh, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, there's a thing\Ncalled brand equity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my designs are popular, they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're all friends here, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for all the help you\Ngave us two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take as much as you can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They took everything we had!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can cut me some slack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Or steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what's all that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Something serious must be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsieur!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an emergency! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone pinch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there in the sky, you can see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the presence of royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing down\Nhere in the lower world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first time seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be wrong in the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He never comes down here\Nunless there's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The merman in front of you is\Nthe king of the Ryugu kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the ruler of Fishman Island,\Nthe god of the sea, Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this dude enormous or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather see a mermaid than a merman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you two shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's super old, and he's\Nsuper hairy, too gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your observations to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel down and show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we talk about how cute the whale is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he here because of the humans? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Megalo, are you certain these\Nare the people you encountered earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We met that shark when we were outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear my words, Straw Hat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Ryugu Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're personally inviting\Nthem to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be a big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta move! Roll faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we should have equipped\Nourselves with paddle wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't ready for\Nthe new world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something in the\Nwater in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Heart Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. See his hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he stuck in those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now, boss? Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one of them after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the first fish\Nman I fought against.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've done your dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my chance to\Nreturn the favor. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,only a damn fish so let\Nme teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with humans, doctor. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah you are we were tough before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're unbeatable with this. Our
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,power drug the energy steroid fish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,men are naturally ten times stronger\Nthan humans but that hasn't made a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,strong enough impression however\Nwith just one pill we can double our
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,strength and finally strike some terror\Ninto their cowardly little hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if i'd go\Nas far as our boss but
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,doubling the dose and\Ndoubling the effect has
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,its benefits, even if it\Ndoes shorten our lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we aren't afraid of dying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,if we can realize our dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the mask, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The handgun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He warned him to prove that he doesn't use
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,hands to sink, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did humans kill Fisher Tiger,\Nbut they also dashed Arlong's dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark chain of events that\Nhave cursed our race end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That is our purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,as a new fishman pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Set them adrift in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay but some of those guys are still\Nalive shouldn't we kill them all first
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No they have a purpose you'll\Nsee those of you who are getting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,away with just cuts and bruises\NWill live to send a message tell the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,people up above what happened to\Nyou in the sea Let them know who
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,did this to you you've seen my\Nstrength firsthand so don't spare
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a single detail Because once we've\Nliberated fish man island from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the gutless god of the sea neptune\Nwe'll be coming To drag you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,humans to the bottom of these\Ndepths I promise you that and the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,fish man will stand on Top of the\Nworld as their supreme species!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A few hours before Luffy met with
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, something unexpected?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An unfortunate encounter\Nwith a barrel at Mermaid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they sure sealed this thing tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's packed up all nice like a.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure chest but it's still a barrel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so maybe some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,fancy boots that'll
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,be enough just give me a second that's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,right stand back thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies but I think I can take it from\Nhere you mean there was a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,stuffed in there? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, too slow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? I'm sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did it all come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How very observant of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's more like\Nquicksand technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it my own personal swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the power of\Nthe swamp, swamp fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly glamorous, but I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't struggle if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That only makes you sink faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just suck you into a\Nmucky hellhole! Help me! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you brain-dead, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop screaming, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down and take a nap, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing my\Nbody's a bottomless pit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,since there's plenty more\Ntreasure to put in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think here, how\Nmuch do mermaids sell for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,70 million at auction, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I nabbed three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is quite the catch, I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those stupid Straw Hats\Nhelp me out after all. If it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,gets me a free pass through\Nimmigration you Can lock me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,in a barrel anytime so what\Nif I plan to cash in on their
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,bounties didn't quite Pan\Nout now I can steal all the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,mermaids I want the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,hat pirates they must be the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ones who Kidnapped your\Nfriends from Mermaid Cove who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,else could it have been\Nhold on they saved Kuma from
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,kidnappers I'm sure you must\Nbe mistaken they were nice they
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't here to cause Any\Ntrouble maybe they needed a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,hostage but why first off let's\Nlook at the facts excluding
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,us Guards and you mermaids\Nthere was nobody else at
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the cove around that time\Nand those thugs from The fish
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,man district were forced to\Nflee a number of the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,hats left but a portion of\NThe crew is still unaccounted
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,for we don't know what\Ntheir intentions may be the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,temptation for humans to kidnap\Nmermaids is just too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're traded at a high\Nprice all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and we have criminals like them to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But they weren't just any pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved Kuma from slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates often make friends with mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when they come down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they use that relationship to kidnap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Fukaboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain, Madam Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This vision that you saw,\Nit is of dire importance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so I must be sure of its accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.74,0:17:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your silence speaks volumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it is as you say, Straw Hat\Nwill bring ruin to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Madam Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it all loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an awful future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The accuracy of your\Npredictions is well known.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced that we must approach\Nthis matter with the utmost caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is quite the shame, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem to have a good\Nreputation with the mermaids,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and they saved my sister's pets,\Nso I wanted to treat them kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that this new\Ndevelopment has come to light,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that I must keep\Na close eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to\Ntake them all into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those weren't just ordinary\Npirates, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune wouldn't have given them a\Npersonal invitation to Ryugu Palace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, you don't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chachach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. What's J'mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds dumb to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, are you stupid or just play crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You got invited to the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much my\Ndaughter loves that shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her favorite pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Megalos never coming back, she\Nsaid, tears welling up in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that he'd\Nbeen attacked by the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude for\Nrescuing him from danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really take credit, but\Nwhatever, it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But the princess has a\Nshark for a pet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that, Papagoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're not as intimate\Nwith the princess as you claim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It did sound fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, someone like me\Ngoing to Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He said we could bring our friends,\Nand you guys definitely make the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent my sons to fetch you, but they\Ntook too long, and I grew impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they returned in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're holding a banquet, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I simply can't stand\Nto wait on any more guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're going to get along great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gru, stop drooling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of guests, I already\Ninvited one of your crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at the palace now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say he was a bit\Nlacking in manners, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He started drinking before the\Nbanquet and wouldn't listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,reason when I advised him to wait\Nfor the other guests to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to have forgotten his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro, okay? Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As surely as they found him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my soldiers will find the rest of your\Ncrew and bring them to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, got any idea where\Neveryone else went, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If we ask around enough, I'm sure somebody\Nwill have the info we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you want to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking to shop, that's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've got an errand of my\Nown I'd like to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where my old\Nshipwright master came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like\Nto see while we're here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not often that I\Nget to explore a culture
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that's completely removed\Nfrom the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone with a discerning\Neye may uncover its secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,or even some pieces of\Na forgotten history.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Robin thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So we split up again,\Nbut it wasn't a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No trouble on your end, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, maybe an itty-bitty bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fish King, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're 10,000 meters below sea level,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,why is it so bright and\Nsunny everywhere we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's likely what our ancestors\Nthought when they first arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only place in the\Ndeep sea that light reaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a glorious glowing\Nbeacon for all of fish
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,mankind and has been for as\Nlong as anyone can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe it all to the giant Sun Tree Eve,\Nwhose mighty roots stretch to these depths,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,carrying shimmering\Nsunlight along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So are its roots bioluminescent, or does\Nit just transfer sunlight from the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The latter, it seems, though scientists\Nhave puzzled over the specifics for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The respiration of its roots also supplies\Noxygen from the surface to our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, we owe our entire\Ncivilization to this single mystic tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's like the big\Nbrother, or in this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,big sister, of the mangroves in Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hairy fish, dude, I'm\Ngetting hungry. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, your highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, allow me to open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Land dwellers don't visit often, so much\Nof the palace is submerged in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want anyone drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamon, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:22:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dragons are sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoppaka's house seems\Npositively shabby in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy me one of these, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.64,0:23:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We were wondering where you ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is going to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.34,0:23:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my honored guests. Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.88,0:23:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And you brought guests along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you not to leave\Nthe palace on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but you don't listen to a word I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't take guards, and\Nyou can't inform your staff,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then you can't leave the\Npalace, and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, sir. Ja, Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He got scolded?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many countless\Nways this could have gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom is in a volatile\Npolitical state right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely as a king, you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could stop scolding me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that I brought\Nback some very important people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the pirates who\Nsaved Megalo from the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's welcome them properly\Nso I can maintain my dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.40,0:24:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Shirahoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess should be here for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.08,0:24:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, your highness,\Nwe had another incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.22,0:24:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And she found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give her another\Nthing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a very delicate girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.70,0:24:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want your daughter to worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,then how about you stay here in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.10,0:24:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,where it's safe instead\Nof running off unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought you might be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.32,0:24:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit unfortunate that\Nyou brought the guest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a development while you were\Nout, and a rather troubling one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.51,0:24:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Fukaboshi called and informed us\Nof something better related and private.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness, this is quite awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the thing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we eating or hold on? Where'd\NLuffy go? Yeah, he was here just a
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,second ago he couldn't stand still\Nfor five minutes if his life depended
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,on it this is the royal palace you\Ndon't just wander around here on your
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,own can't smell anything now the food\Nmust be through those giant doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.58,0:25:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this place looks pretty fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.30,0:25:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the banquet hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.62,0:25:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope Zoro hasn't\Neaten all the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.08,0:25:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But man, kind of intimidating, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The doors are overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.34,0:25:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm backing Impel down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't want people\Ngetting their food, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean whatever they've\Ngot in there is super good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.55,0:26:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark. Why is it dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The food smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.58,0:26:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's going to be a surprise party.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I think\NI've waited long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.18,0:26:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A little snack will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like some kind of coral,\Nbut why is it in a banquet hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Squishy again, weird
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone's here, could\Nyou turn on the lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Still really confused,\Nbut this here is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.76,0:26:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a horrid thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.72,0:27:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bouncing on a poor, helpless\Ngirl such as myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.38,0:27:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, sir, and\Nwhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.78,0:27:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.14,0:27:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one big lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.28,0:27:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, big fish lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.14,0:27:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to kill me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I will have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.86,0:27:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not of anyone else, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.90,0:27:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the daughter of King Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not, I'm not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.26,0:27:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.34,0:27:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to kill you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.72,0:27:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.70,0:27:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
